  "system": {
    "identifier": "ranton-storm-release-black-lightning",
    "description": "<p>You begin to release a surge of Chakra from your body, boosting your Storm release to new heights. Your Lightning Release Chakra begins to turn black or darker in tone and color. This Lightning surges around you and begins to solidify around you as an aura of black electricity.</p>\n<p>For the duration, jutsu you cast with the Lightning Release keyword or that would deal Lightning damage are now the same color as your darkened electricity. Jutsu you cast for the duration, gain the following;</p>\n<p>They cannot have their cost increased by hostile effects.</p>\n<p>If the jutsu requires concentration, it gains the Stable or Efficient keyword, pick one.</p>\n<p>If the jutsu has an Overcharge effect, you can choose to increase its cost by +2, to use its effect without spending the Bonus action.</p>",
